{{!
    @template format_aicourse/report_page

    The per-course AI Tutor report: page heading, tab strip and the active tab.

    The tab strip is a <nav> of ordinary links rather than a JavaScript tab widget, because each
    tab is a separate server-rendered view with its own URL. The active link carries
    aria-current="page".

    Heading levels: Moodle's page header already emits the <h1> (the course full name), so the
    report title here is an <h2>, each region inside a tab is an <h3> and each card title an <h4>.
    There is exactly one <h1> on the page and no level is skipped.

    Classes required for JS:
    * None.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * None.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title string Page heading, from the language pack.
    * tabslabel string Accessible name of the tab strip navigation landmark.
    * tabs array Tab links.
      * label string Visible tab label.
      * url string Target URL, already through moodle_url::out().
      * active bool True for the tab currently being shown.
    * iscontent bool True when the course content tab is active.
    * ishistory bool True when the chat history tab is active.
    * contenttab object|null Context for format_aicourse/report_content_tab, or null.
    * historytab object|null Context for format_aicourse/report_history_tab, or null.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "AI Tutor Report",
        "tabslabel": "AI Tutor report sections",
        "tabs": [
            {"label": "Course Content", "url": "#content", "active": true},
            {"label": "Chat History", "url": "#history", "active": false}
        ],
        "iscontent": true,
        "ishistory": false,
        "contenttab": {
            "sectioncount": 4,
            "activitycount": 12,
            "charactercount": "18,204",
            "hascoursesummary": true,
            "coursesummary": "<p>An introduction to astrophysics.</p>",
            "hasactivities": true,
            "activities": [
                {
                    "name": "Welcome page",
                    "type": "page",
                    "icon": "<i class=\"icon fa fa-file\"></i>",
                    "haspreview": true,
                    "preview": "Start here before the first seminar."
                }
            ]
        },
        "historytab": null
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-report-container">
    <div class="aicourse-report-header">
        <h2 class="aicourse-report-title d-flex align-items-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="mr-2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M12 8V4H8"/>
                <rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/>
                <path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
            <span>{{title}}</span>
        </h2>
    </div>

    <nav class="aicourse-tabs" aria-label="{{tabslabel}}">
        {{#tabs}}
        <a href="{{url}}" class="aicourse-tab{{#active}} active{{/active}}"{{#active}} aria-current="page"{{/active}}>{{label}}</a>
        {{/tabs}}
    </nav>

    {{#contenttab}}
    {{> format_aicourse/report_content_tab }}
    {{/contenttab}}
    {{#historytab}}
    {{> format_aicourse/report_history_tab }}
    {{/historytab}}
</div>
